  "updated": "2026-07-10",
  "purpose": "C16/H1/H2/H3/H4/H5 seed for a calm, biophilic, skinnable presentation layer: semantic tokens, day-cycle variants, nature-paced motion doctrine, materiality contracts, component contracts, generalized SVG art tokens, and the canonical values-bloom substrate that app code can consume later without hard-coding a skin.",
  "principles": [
    "beauty must not farm attention",
    "nature-paced motion beats engagement loops",
    "semantic tokens travel across instances",
    "contrast is computed, not asserted",
    "art tokens decorate meaning and navigation, not noise"
